# Workflow Diagram

# Module 10 Workflow (Mermaid)

```mermaid
flowchart TD

A[User Request]
--> B[Story Analysis]

B --> C[Story Planning]

C --> D[Scene Planning]

D --> E[Shot Planning]

E --> F[Character Direction]

F --> G[Camera Direction]

G --> H[Prompt Generation]

H --> I[Quality Assurance]

I --> J{QA PASS?}

J -->|Yes| K[Production Package]

K --> L[Release Package]

L --> M[AI Studio Runtime]

J -->|No| N[Revise Story / Prompt]

N --> C
```

---

# Workflow Stages

1. Story Analysis
2. Story Planning
3. Scene Planning
4. Shot Planning
5. Character Direction
6. Camera Direction
7. Prompt Generation
8. Quality Assurance
9. Production Package
10. Release Package

